### 7. EDA Tools
EDA (Electronic Design Automation) tools automate different stages of ASIC design including:

- HDL Simulation
- Logic Synthesis
- Floorplanning
- Placement
- Clock Tree Synthesis
- Routing
- Static Timing Analysis
- DRC & LVS
- Sign-off

