### 8. RTL to GDSII Flow
The RTL-to-GDSII flow consists of:

1. Synthesis
2. Floorplanning
3. Power Planning
4. Placement
5. Clock Tree Synthesis
6. Routing
7. Sign-off

The final output is the GDSII layout file used for fabrication.

![RTL to GDSII Flow](Images/08_rtl_to_gdsii_flow.png)
